## Remote Connectivity Verification

Remote access was tested from a Windows system connected through Tailscale.

The remote system successfully reached DC01:

```text
10.10.20.10
```

using ICMP.

Example:

```text
ping 10.10.20.10
```

The test returned replies with no packet loss.

